History of heart failure with reduced ejection fraction. Echocardiogram reported EF 35%, improved from 25%. Weight 74.2 kg and BP 118/72. Continue sacubitril/valsartan, carvedilol 25 mg twice daily, spironolactone 25 mg daily, and furosemide 40 mg daily. Device interrogation showed no sustained ventricular arrhythmia; pacemaker serial: {{device}}.

