History of schizoaffective disorder, bipolar type, and stimulant use disorder. Mood is anxious; affect is constricted. Denies suicidal or homicidal ideation and denies command hallucinations. Continue olanzapine 10 mg nightly and divalproex ER 1,000 mg nightly. Valproate level 68 mcg/mL. Safety plan reviewed.

