Postoperative day 2 after laparoscopic right hemicolectomy. Incisions are clean, dry, and intact. Abdomen is soft with expected tenderness. WBC 9.8 K/uL, hemoglobin 11.1 g/dL. Advance to low-residue diet, continue enoxaparin prophylaxis, encourage ambulation, and remove Foley catheter. Implant serial: {{device}}.

