The patient is 7 years old and weighs 24.6 kg. Mild persistent asthma with two nighttime symptoms this month. Lungs are clear without retractions. Continue fluticasone 44 mcg two puffs twice daily and albuterol two puffs every four hours as needed. Spacer technique reviewed.

