At 28 weeks 4 days gestation by first-trimester ultrasound. Fetal heart rate 148 bpm, fundal height 29 cm, BP 122/76. One-hour glucose challenge was 116 mg/dL. Blood type O positive. Continue prenatal vitamin and low-dose aspirin 81 mg daily. No bleeding, contractions, or loss of fluid.

