Ileocolonic Crohn disease in clinical remission on infliximab 5 mg/kg every eight weeks. One formed stool daily without bleeding or nocturnal symptoms. Fecal calprotectin is 74 mcg/g, CRP 2.1 mg/L, albumin 4.0 g/dL, AST 21 U/L, and ALT 19 U/L. Surveillance colonoscopy showed mild pseudopolyposis without active ulceration.

