Seropositive rheumatoid arthritis with low disease activity. Tender joint count 2 and swollen joint count 1. Morning stiffness lasts 20 minutes. ESR is 18 mm/hr and CRP is 3.0 mg/L. Continue methotrexate 20 mg weekly, folic acid 1 mg daily, and adalimumab 40 mg every other week. No oral ulcers, rash, or recent infection.

