Primary open-angle glaucoma, moderate stage in both eyes. Visual acuity is 20/25 right eye and 20/30 left eye. Intraocular pressure is 14 mmHg OD and 15 mmHg OS. Optical coherence tomography shows stable superior retinal nerve fiber layer thinning. Continue latanoprost one drop in both eyes nightly. No diabetic retinopathy or macular edema.

