Benign prostatic hyperplasia with lower urinary tract symptoms. International Prostate Symptom Score is 12. Post-void residual is 68 mL. Urinalysis is negative for blood, nitrite, and leukocyte esterase. PSA is 2.7 ng/mL. Continue tamsulosin 0.4 mg nightly. No dysuria, gross hematuria, urinary retention, flank pain, fever, or chills.
